<title>USA: L.A. T Sportswear settles shareholder suit.</title>
<headline>L.A. T Sportswear settles shareholder suit.</headline>
<dateline>BALL GROUND, Ga. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>L.A. T Sportswear Inc on Thursday said it settled  a lawsuit filed in March 1994 by shareholder Edward Slate, alleging the company's initial public offering documents were misleading.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement were not disclosed.</p>
